  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9418.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El bar Azahar, en el barrio del Tossalet, en Onda, ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado, 10 de mayo, una jornada de competici&oacute;n de futbol&iacute;n.&nbsp;Al final de los enfrentamientos,</span></span>&nbsp;s<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">e han entregado tambi&eacute;n los premios de la Liga celebrada durante esta temporada.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9394.jpg\" alt=\"img_9394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9395.jpg\" alt=\"img_9395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9396.jpg\" alt=\"img_9396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9398.jpg\" alt=\"img_9398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9399.jpg\" alt=\"img_9399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9400.jpg\" alt=\"img_9400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100514/img_9402.jpg\" alt=\"img_9402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafutbolitossaletonda100